[{"page": 1, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q2-1", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "T2. Kinetics of the Belousov-Zhabotinsky reaction", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 151.06434631347656, 449.7819519042969, 172.77197265625]}, {"text": "6%", "bbox": [290.6499938964844, 193.70750427246094, 304.6280822753906, 207.2747344970703]}, {"text": "2.1", "bbox": [172.68299865722656, 209.6475067138672, 186.7479705810547, 223.21473693847656]}, {"text": "2.2", "bbox": [204.3090057373047, 209.6475067138672, 218.37399291992188, 223.21473693847656]}, {"text": "2.3", "bbox": [235.93499755859375, 209.6475067138672, 249.99998474121094, 223.21473693847656]}, {"text": "2.4", "bbox": [267.5610046386719, 209.6475067138672, 281.6259765625, 223.21473693847656]}, {"text": "2.5", "bbox": [299.18701171875, 209.6475067138672, 313.2519836425781, 223.21473693847656]}, {"text": "2.6", "bbox": [330.81298828125, 209.6475067138672, 344.8779602050781, 223.21473693847656]}, {"text": "2.7", "bbox": [362.4389953613281, 209.6475067138672, 376.50396728515625, 223.21473693847656]}, {"text": "∑", "bbox": [403.7760009765625, 194.75196838378906, 412.8818054199219, 229.34210205078125]}, {"text": "2", "bbox": [176.86700439453125, 225.5885009765625, 182.5634002685547, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "11", "bbox": [205.64500427246094, 225.5885009765625, 217.04000854492188, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "4", "bbox": [240.11900329589844, 225.5885009765625, 245.81539916992188, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "2", "bbox": [271.7449951171875, 225.5885009765625, 277.4413757324219, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "9", "bbox": [303.3710021972656, 225.5885009765625, 309.0673828125, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "4", "bbox": [334.99700927734375, 225.5885009765625, 340.6933898925781, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "3", "bbox": [366.62298583984375, 225.5885009765625, 372.3193664550781, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "35", "bbox": [402.6319885253906, 225.5885009765625, 414.0269775390625, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "When the chemicals KBrO3, CH2(COOH)2 (malonic acid, – MA), Ce(SO4)2, and H2SO4 are mixed, the", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 234.54714965820312, 538.5816650390625, 300.49957275390625]}, {"text": "concentration, 𝐶, of Ce species and the colour of the solution oscillates between yellow (due to Ce4+)", "bbox": [56.69293212890625, 248.5091552734375, 538.582763671875, 314.4615783691406]}, {"text": "and colourless (due to Ce3+). A schematic picture is given below:", "bbox": [56.692901611328125, 261.9451599121094, 357.6814880371094, 327.8975830078125]}, {"text": "2.1", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 548.0745239257812, 92.84233856201172, 561.6417236328125]}, {"text": "Write the overall balanced reaction equation of the Belousov-Zhabotinsky reac-", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 548.0745239257812, 480.5935974121094, 561.6417236328125]}, {"text": "tion (BZ reaction). Note: in this reaction, MA is oxidised to CO2, BrO−", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 535.2111206054688, 430.1299743652344, 601.1635131835938]}, {"text": "3 is reduced", "bbox": [423.98797607421875, 552.376220703125, 480.5915832519531, 583.507568359375]}, {"text": "to Br−, and Ce(IV) is a catalyst.", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 548.608154296875, 257.0640869140625, 614.560546875]}, {"text": "Solution:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 585.3825073242188, 158.84678649902344, 598.94970703125]}, {"text": "3CH2(COOH)2 + 4BrO−", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 572.5191650390625, 223.30397033691406, 638.4715576171875]}, {"text": "3 →9CO2 + 4Br−+ 6H2O", "bbox": [217.1619873046875, 572.5191650390625, 333.73992919921875, 638.4715576171875]}, {"text": "or", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 609.2925415039062, 124.83379364013672, 622.8597412109375]}, {"text": "3CH2(COOH)2 + 4KBrO3 →9CO2 + 4KBr + 6H2O", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 596.42919921875, 340.3849182128906, 662.381591796875]}, {"text": "For fully correct reaction equation: 2 points.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 645.1575317382812, 319.6224060058594, 658.7247314453125]}, {"text": "If only coefficient of H2O is wrong: 1 point.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 632.295166015625, 314.14715576171875, 698.24755859375]}, {"text": "2.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 547.99951171875, 521.8194580078125, 561.5667114257812]}]}, {"page": 2, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q2-2", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "The mechanism of the BZ reaction is shown below (BMA −CHBr(COOH)2):", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 130.40113830566406, 407.3403625488281, 196.35354614257812]}, {"text": "Process A", "bbox": [63.069000244140625, 226.5465087890625, 108.03180694580078, 240.11373901367188]}, {"text": "⎧", "bbox": [110.6300048828125, 186.3079833984375, 117.00606536865234, 220.89813232421875]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.6300048828125, 195.3359832763672, 117.00606536865234, 229.92611694335938]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.6300048828125, 204.7539825439453, 117.00606536865234, 239.3441162109375]}, {"text": "⎨", "bbox": [110.6300048828125, 214.17198181152344, 117.00606536865234, 248.76211547851562]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.6300048828125, 223.58998107910156, 117.00606536865234, 258.18011474609375]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.6300048828125, 233.00698852539062, 117.00606536865234, 267.5971374511719]}, {"text": "⎩", "bbox": [110.6300048828125, 241.98599243164062, 117.00606536865234, 276.5761413574219]}, {"text": "(1) HBrO2 + BrO−", "bbox": [117.00599670410156, 180.0631561279297, 198.4779815673828, 246.01556396484375]}, {"text": "3 + H+ 𝑘1", "bbox": [192.33599853515625, 180.0631561279297, 238.69305419921875, 246.01556396484375]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [227.10800170898438, 189.9659881591797, 233.93238830566406, 224.55612182617188]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [230.65469360351562, 189.9659881591797, 237.4790802001953, 224.55612182617188]}, {"text": "→2BrO⋅", "bbox": [234.20138549804688, 180.0631561279297, 272.44940185546875, 246.01556396484375]}, {"text": "2 + H2O", "bbox": [269.885009765625, 180.0631561279297, 306.32293701171875, 246.01556396484375]}, {"text": "(2) BrO⋅", "bbox": [117.00602722167969, 205.04115295410156, 152.4844207763672, 270.9935607910156]}, {"text": "2 + Ce3+ + H+ 𝑘2", "bbox": [149.92002868652344, 205.0411376953125, 228.61106872558594, 270.9935607910156]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [217.02601623535156, 214.9439697265625, 223.85040283203125, 249.53411865234375]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [220.5727081298828, 214.9439697265625, 227.3970947265625, 249.53411865234375]}, {"text": "→HBrO2 + Ce4+", "bbox": [224.11940002441406, 205.0411376953125, 300.7682189941406, 270.9935607910156]}, {"text": "(3) 2HBrO2", "bbox": [117.00602722167969, 229.74212646484375, 166.85623168945312, 295.6945495605469]}, {"text": "𝑘3", "bbox": [172.86203002929688, 233.89022827148438, 181.7070770263672, 266.3609313964844]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [170.12203979492188, 239.64495849609375, 176.94642639160156, 274.235107421875]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [173.66871643066406, 239.64495849609375, 180.49310302734375, 274.235107421875]}, {"text": "→BrO−", "bbox": [177.21539306640625, 229.74212646484375, 214.0590057373047, 295.6945495605469]}, {"text": "3 + HBrO + H+", "bbox": [207.91702270507812, 229.74212646484375, 276.8590087890625, 295.6945495605469]}, {"text": "𝑘1 = 1.0 × 104 M−2 s−1", "bbox": [412.7439880371094, 175.41314697265625, 514.3911743164062, 245.35154724121094]}, {"text": "𝑘2 = 6.2 × 104 M−2 s−1", "bbox": [412.74395751953125, 193.0321502685547, 514.39111328125, 262.9695739746094]}, {"text": "𝑘3 = 4.0 × 107 M−1 s−1", "bbox": [412.7439270019531, 210.650146484375, 514.39111328125, 280.58856201171875]}, {"text": "Process B", "bbox": [63.069000244140625, 296.4905090332031, 108.13882446289062, 310.0577392578125]}, {"text": "⎧", "bbox": [110.73699951171875, 257.37799072265625, 117.1130599975586, 291.9681396484375]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.73699951171875, 265.6769714355469, 117.1130599975586, 300.2671203613281]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.73699951171875, 274.8959655761719, 117.1130599975586, 309.4861145019531]}, {"text": "⎨", "bbox": [110.73699951171875, 284.1149597167969, 117.1130599975586, 318.7051086425781]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.73699951171875, 293.3339538574219, 117.1130599975586, 327.9241027832031]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.73699951171875, 302.5529479980469, 117.1130599975586, 337.1430969238281]}, {"text": "⎩", "bbox": [110.73699951171875, 310.8029479980469, 117.1130599975586, 345.3930969238281]}, {"text": "(4) HBrO2 + Br−+ H+ 𝑘4", "bbox": [117.11299896240234, 251.13311767578125, 231.04905700683594, 317.0855407714844]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [219.4650115966797, 261.03594970703125, 226.28939819335938, 295.6260986328125]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [223.01170349121094, 261.03594970703125, 229.83609008789062, 295.6260986328125]}, {"text": "→2HBrO", "bbox": [226.5583953857422, 251.13311767578125, 269.7127380371094, 317.0855407714844]}, {"text": "(5) BrO−", "bbox": [117.11300659179688, 274.97711181640625, 156.1689910888672, 340.9295349121094]}, {"text": "3 + Br−+ 2H+ 𝑘5", "bbox": [150.02700805664062, 274.97711181640625, 230.21705627441406, 340.9295349121094]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [218.6330108642578, 284.87994384765625, 225.4573974609375, 319.4700927734375]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [222.17970275878906, 284.87994384765625, 229.00408935546875, 319.4700927734375]}, {"text": "→HBrO + HBrO2", "bbox": [225.7263946533203, 274.97711181640625, 305.81719970703125, 340.9295349121094]}, {"text": "(6) HBrO + MA", "bbox": [117.11302185058594, 299.8041076660156, 185.35968017578125, 365.75653076171875]}, {"text": "𝑘6", "bbox": [190.86703491210938, 303.9521789550781, 199.71206665039062, 336.4228820800781]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [188.1270294189453, 309.7069396972656, 194.951416015625, 344.2970886230469]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [191.6737060546875, 309.7069396972656, 198.4980926513672, 344.2970886230469]}, {"text": "→BMA + H2O", "bbox": [195.22039794921875, 299.8041076660156, 262.3309326171875, 365.75653076171875]}, {"text": "𝑘4 = 2.0 × 109 M−2 s−1", "bbox": [412.7439880371094, 250.80712890625, 514.3911743164062, 320.74554443359375]}, {"text": "𝑘5 = 2.1 M−3 s−1", "bbox": [412.74395751953125, 268.4261474609375, 488.64312744140625, 338.3635559082031]}, {"text": "𝑘6 = 8.2 M−1 s−1", "bbox": [412.74395751953125, 286.04412841796875, 488.64312744140625, 355.9825439453125]}, {"text": "Process C {(7) Ce4+ + BMA", "bbox": [63.069000244140625, 338.1351318359375, 193.13418579101562, 404.0875549316406]}, {"text": "𝑘7", "bbox": [198.64199829101562, 342.3312072753906, 207.48704528808594, 374.8019104003906]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [195.90200805664062, 348.0379638671875, 202.7263946533203, 382.62811279296875]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [199.4486846923828, 348.0379638671875, 206.2730712890625, 382.62811279296875]}, {"text": "→Ce3+ + Br−+ other products", "bbox": [202.99537658691406, 338.1351318359375, 348.3592529296875, 404.0875549316406]}, {"text": "𝑘7 = 1.0 × 102 M−1 s−1", "bbox": [412.7439880371094, 330.6851501464844, 514.3911743164062, 400.6235656738281]}, {"text": "In the BZ reaction, Process C occurs continuously, while Processes A and B alternate with each other.", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 404.8955078125, 538.5765380859375, 418.4627380371094]}, {"text": "Assume that:", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 416.8504943847656, 117.88394165039062, 430.417724609375]}, {"text": "- when Process A occurs the solution is yellow and Process B practically does not occur;", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 434.78350830078125, 466.40802001953125, 448.3507385253906]}, {"text": "- when Process B occurs the solution is colourless and Process A practically does not occur;", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 452.71551513671875, 484.2220458984375, 466.2827453613281]}, {"text": "- [BrO3−]0 = 0.06 M, [MA]0 = 0.1 M, [H+]0 = 0.8 M, [Ce4+]0 = 0.001 M;", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 456.16021728515625, 374.41668701171875, 494.67010498046875]}, {"text": "- the concentrations of the reactants (except Ce4+) and pH are maintained constant throughout the BZ", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 467.2851257324219, 538.5810546875, 533.237548828125]}, {"text": "reaction.", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 504.0584716796875, 97.72960662841797, 517.6256713867188]}]}, {"page": 3, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q2-3", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "2.2", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 166.17649841308594, 92.84233856201172, 179.7437286376953]}, {"text": "Using the steady-state approximation, calculate the stationary molar concen-", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 166.17649841308594, 480.5784912109375, 179.7437286376953]}, {"text": "trations of HBrO2 in Processes A and B, [HBrO2]A and [HBrO2]B.", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 153.31314086914062, 418.2455749511719, 221.7565460205078]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 190.0865020751953, 169.74588012695312, 203.6537322998047]}, {"text": "𝑑[BrO⋅", "bbox": [115.88700103759766, 186.22662353515625, 143.29844665527344, 245.5841827392578]}, {"text": "2]", "bbox": [141.0189971923828, 195.13922119140625, 148.48880004882812, 229.53591918945312]}, {"text": "𝑑𝑡", "bbox": [128.1300048828125, 207.501220703125, 136.24459838867188, 238.632568359375]}, {"text": "= 2𝑘1[HBrO2][BrO−", "bbox": [152.45199584960938, 190.25914001464844, 243.3739776611328, 256.2115478515625]}, {"text": "3 ][H+] −𝑘2[BrO⋅", "bbox": [237.23199462890625, 190.25914001464844, 313.6143798828125, 256.2115478515625]}, {"text": "2][Ce3+][H+] = 0", "bbox": [311.04998779296875, 190.25914001464844, 386.8054504394531, 256.2115478515625]}, {"text": "(eq.2.1)", "bbox": [395.3135070800781, 190.25914001464844, 427.1365661621094, 256.2115478515625]}, {"text": "𝑑[HBrO2]", "bbox": [115.88703918457031, 213.07861328125, 155.2128448486328, 272.4361877441406]}, {"text": "𝑑𝑡", "bbox": [131.4929962158203, 232.42721557617188, 139.5986328125, 263.5585632324219]}, {"text": "= −𝑘1[HBrO2][BrO−", "bbox": [159.17599487304688, 215.1851348876953, 251.9419708251953, 281.1375427246094]}, {"text": "3 ][H+]+𝑘2[BrO⋅", "bbox": [245.79998779296875, 215.1851348876953, 318.3013610839844, 281.1375427246094]}, {"text": "2][Ce3+][H+]−2𝑘3[HBrO2]2 = 0", "bbox": [315.7369689941406, 215.1851348876953, 456.45721435546875, 281.1375427246094]}, {"text": "(eq.2.2)", "bbox": [464.96527099609375, 215.1851348876953, 496.7904357910156, 281.1375427246094]}, {"text": "When adding equations 2.1 and 2.2 we get the following:", "bbox": [114.69088745117188, 263.91351318359375, 380.5534362792969, 277.4807434082031]}, {"text": "𝑘1[HBrO2][BrO−", "bbox": [114.69088745117188, 263.0061340332031, 191.0398712158203, 328.95855712890625]}, {"text": "3 ][H+] −2𝑘3[HBrO2]2 = 0 (eq.2.3)", "bbox": [184.89788818359375, 263.0061340332031, 339.5486755371094, 328.9585876464844]}, {"text": "[HBrO2]𝐴= 𝑘1", "bbox": [114.69087219238281, 286.9161376953125, 184.05792236328125, 352.8685607910156]}, {"text": "2𝑘3 [BrO−", "bbox": [172.9720001220703, 286.9161376953125, 216.16297912597656, 352.8685607910156]}, {"text": "3 ][H+] (eq.2.4)", "bbox": [210.02099609375, 286.9161376953125, 277.9367370605469, 352.8685607910156]}, {"text": "[HBrO2]𝐴=", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 313.6251525878906, 169.0083770751953, 379.57757568359375]}, {"text": "1.0×104", "bbox": [178.0819854736328, 320.270751953125, 207.9800262451172, 352.4325866699219]}, {"text": "2×4.0×107 × 0.06 × 0.8 = 6.0 × 10−6 M", "bbox": [172.9720001220703, 322.0982360839844, 334.611328125, 363.3875732421875]}, {"text": "The steady-state approximation for Process B:", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 362.3534851074219, 331.6946105957031, 375.92071533203125]}, {"text": "𝑑[HBrO2]", "bbox": [115.88699340820312, 360.3545837402344, 155.21279907226562, 419.712158203125]}, {"text": "𝑑𝑡", "bbox": [131.4929962158203, 379.7032165527344, 139.5986328125, 410.8345642089844]}, {"text": "= −𝑘4[HBrO2][Br−][H+] + 𝑘5[BrO−", "bbox": [159.17599487304688, 362.4611511230469, 318.5569763183594, 428.41357421875]}, {"text": "3 ][Br−][H+]2 = 0 (eq.2.5)", "bbox": [312.41497802734375, 362.461181640625, 426.88677978515625, 428.4136047363281]}, {"text": "[HBrO2]𝐵= 𝑘5", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 386.37115478515625, 181.987060546875, 452.3235778808594]}, {"text": "𝑘4 [BrO−", "bbox": [173.14199829101562, 386.37115478515625, 211.84999084472656, 452.3235778808594]}, {"text": "3 ][H+] (eq.2.6)", "bbox": [205.7080078125, 386.3711853027344, 273.6237487792969, 452.3236083984375]}, {"text": "[HBrO2]𝐵=", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 410.28216552734375, 169.1783905029297, 476.2345886230469]}, {"text": "2.1", "bbox": [182.73599243164062, 417.958251953125, 193.94398498535156, 449.089599609375]}, {"text": "2.0×109 × 0.06 × 0.8 = 5.04 × 10−11 M", "bbox": [173.14199829101562, 418.7552490234375, 334.0243225097656, 460.15557861328125]}, {"text": "[HBrO2]𝐴= 6.0 × 10−6 M", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 434.192138671875, 227.746337890625, 500.1445617675781]}, {"text": "[HBrO2]𝐵= 5.04 × 10−11 M", "bbox": [247.67100524902344, 434.192138671875, 370.361328125, 500.1445617675781]}, {"text": "For fully correct equations 2.1, 2.2 and 2.5: 2 points each.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 482.9205017089844, 381.2808837890625, 496.48773193359375]}, {"text": "If only one incorrect coefficient in front of the rate constant in equations 2.1,", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 506.83148193359375, 480.578125, 520.398681640625]}, {"text": "2.2 and 2.5: 1 point each.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 518.7864379882812, 232.1606903076172, 532.3536376953125]}, {"text": "For corresponding equations 2.3, 2.4 and 2.6: 1 point each.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 542.6964721679688, 389.7989501953125, 556.263671875]}, {"text": "For calculated [HBrO2]A and [HBrO2]B values: 1 point each.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 541.7890625, 393.9190673828125, 607.741455078125]}, {"text": "For correct calculation without formula derivation: full marks.", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 590.5174560546875, 402.0528869628906, 604.0846557617188]}, {"text": "11.0 pt", "bbox": [495.1520080566406, 166.10049438476562, 526.921142578125, 179.667724609375]}, {"text": "If you could not calculate [HBrO2]A and [HBrO2]B, you can use the values [HBrO2]A = 1 × 10−5 M and", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 593.1381225585938, 538.5824584960938, 659.0905151367188]}, {"text": "[HBrO2]B = 1 × 10−10 M for the following calculations.", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 606.672119140625, 300.0137939453125, 672.62451171875]}]}, {"page": 4, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q2-4", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "During the BZ reaction, the concentrations of HBrO2 and Br−oscillate strictly in relation to each other,", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 130.40113830566406, 538.5963134765625, 196.35354614257812]}, {"text": "and this is sketched in the phase portrait of [HBrO2] vs [Br−]:", "bbox": [56.692962646484375, 142.35614013671875, 341.3666076660156, 208.3085479736328]}, {"text": "Here [Br−]max is the maximum concentration and [Br−]critical is the critical concentration of Br−at which", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 415.3631286621094, 538.5804443359375, 481.3155517578125]}, {"text": "there is a switch over in processes from A to B or from B to A. To switch Process A to Process B, the", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 452.136474609375, 538.5736083984375, 465.7037048339844]}, {"text": "reaction rate of the elementary step (4) must exceed that of the elementary step (1) and vice versa.", "bbox": [56.693023681640625, 464.09246826171875, 517.005615234375, 477.6596984863281]}, {"text": "2.3", "bbox": [78.60802459716797, 487.00347900390625, 92.84236145019531, 500.5707092285156]}, {"text": "Calculate [Br−]critical.", "bbox": [114.69256591796875, 462.1851501464844, 217.95263671875, 528.1375732421875]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 498.9595031738281, 169.74588012695312, 512.5267333984375]}, {"text": "During the switching process the following equality is observed:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 510.91448974609375, 413.2110290527344, 524.481689453125]}, {"text": "𝑘1[HBrO2][BrO−", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 510.006103515625, 191.0399932861328, 575.95849609375]}, {"text": "3 ][H+] = 𝑘4[HBrO2][Br−][H+] (eq.3.1)", "bbox": [184.89801025390625, 510.00616455078125, 358.612548828125, 575.9585571289062]}, {"text": "[Br−]𝑐𝑟𝑖𝑡𝑖𝑐𝑎𝑙= 𝑘1", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 540.72216796875, 189.3670654296875, 579.9974975585938]}, {"text": "𝑘4 [BrO−", "bbox": [180.52200317382812, 542.3902587890625, 218.8889923095703, 585.43408203125]}, {"text": "3 ] (eq.3.2)", "bbox": [212.74700927734375, 533.9161987304688, 260.1945495605469, 599.8685913085938]}, {"text": "[Br−]𝑐𝑟𝑖𝑡𝑖𝑐𝑎𝑙= 1.0×104", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 560.6251831054688, 210.7890625, 626.5775756835938]}, {"text": "2.0×109 ⋅0.06 = 3.0 × 10−7 M", "bbox": [180.8909912109375, 569.0992431640625, 305.52435302734375, 610.49951171875]}, {"text": "[Br−]𝑐𝑟𝑖𝑡𝑖𝑐𝑎𝑙= 3.0 × 10−7 M", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 593.00927734375, 235.2963409423828, 630.6165771484375]}, {"text": "For fully correct equation 3.1: 1 point.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 633.2645263671875, 290.5614929199219, 646.8317260742188]}, {"text": "For fully correct equation 3.2: 2 points.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 645.2195434570312, 295.3335876464844, 658.7867431640625]}, {"text": "For calculated [Br−]critical value: 1 point.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 632.356201171875, 303.3588562011719, 698.30859375]}, {"text": "For correct calculation without formula derivation: full marks.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 669.1295776367188, 402.05291748046875, 682.69677734375]}, {"text": "4.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 486.9284973144531, 521.8194580078125, 500.4957275390625]}, {"text": "If you could not calculate [Br−]critical, use [Br−]critical = 1 × 10−7 M for the following calculations.", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 671.7501220703125, 490.7857360839844, 737.7025146484375]}]}, {"page": 5, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q2-5", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "2.4", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 166.2294921875, 92.84233856201172, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "In which direction in the phase portrait of [HBrO2] vs [Br−] will the concentra-", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 141.4111328125, 480.5902404785156, 207.36354064941406]}, {"text": "tions of [HBrO2] and [Br−] change over time? Tick the correct box.", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 153.36614990234375, 425.509765625, 219.3185577392578]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 190.1405029296875, 169.74588012695312, 203.70773315429688]}, {"text": "As the process should be cyclic and not converge in equilibrium points, options", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 202.0955047607422, 480.567626953125, 215.66273498535156]}, {"text": "c and d do not fit this criterion.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 214.05050659179688, 258.9572448730469, 227.61773681640625]}, {"text": "If 𝑟1 > 𝑟4 (relatively low concentration of bromide) Process B switches to Pro-", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 211.08998107910156, 480.5904235839844, 248.17111206054688]}, {"text": "cess A, otherwise if 𝑟1 < 𝑟4 (relatively high concentration of bromide) Process", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 223.04498291015625, 480.58990478515625, 260.1261291503906]}, {"text": "A switches to Process B. During process A concentration of bromide increases", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 249.91552734375, 480.5824890136719, 263.4827575683594]}, {"text": "(due to conjugate process C), while during process B it decreases. So the right", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 261.87152099609375, 480.5797424316406, 275.4387512207031]}, {"text": "option should account for the change in concentrations in such a way that fits", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 273.8265075683594, 480.5675964355469, 287.39373779296875]}, {"text": "this scenario. Therefore, the correct answer is a clockwise phase portrait.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 285.781494140625, 455.721435546875, 299.3487243652344]}, {"text": "Only for correct answer: 2 points.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 560.0764770507812, 270.9550476074219, 573.6436767578125]}, {"text": "2.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 166.15451049804688, 521.8194580078125, 179.72174072265625]}, {"text": "The system does not traverse the phase portrait of [HBrO2] vs [Br−] at a constant velocity, that is the", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 564.9491577148438, 538.5867309570312, 630.9015502929688]}, {"text": "concentration of [Br−] slowly decreases from [Br−]max = 7.0 × 10−4 M to [Br−]critical, and then almost", "bbox": [56.692962646484375, 578.483154296875, 538.5718994140625, 644.435546875]}, {"text": "immediately reaches [Br−]max again.", "bbox": [56.692962646484375, 590.4381713867188, 229.1018829345703, 656.3905639648438]}]}, {"page": 6, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q2-6", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "2.5", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 166.2294921875, 92.84233856201172, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "Calculate based on the data the period of oscillations, 𝜏, of the BZ reaction, in", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 151.31396484375, 480.58551025390625, 185.90411376953125]}, {"text": "seconds.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 178.18450927734375, 155.61802673339844, 191.75173950195312]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 190.1405029296875, 169.74588012695312, 203.70773315429688]}, {"text": "From the conditions of the problem, it can be understood that the period of", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 202.0955047607422, 480.5599670410156, 215.66273498535156]}, {"text": "oscillations, 𝜏(s), is equal to the time it takes for the concentration of bromide", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 199.13497924804688, 480.5914611816406, 233.72512817382812]}, {"text": "to decrease from the maximum to the critical value. The decrease in bromide", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 226.00550842285156, 480.5870666503906, 239.57273864746094]}, {"text": "concentration occurs during Process B.", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 237.96051025390625, 299.1455993652344, 251.52774047851562]}, {"text": "Let's write a kinetic equation for the change of [Br−] considering", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 237.05316162109375, 415.84375, 303.0055847167969]}, {"text": "[Ce4+] ≈0 →𝑘7 [Ce4+] [BMA] ≈0 (eq.5.1) during Process B:", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 252.1241455078125, 393.1806335449219, 318.0765686035156]}, {"text": "−𝑑[Br−]", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 274.7705993652344, 149.81182861328125, 334.128173828125]}, {"text": "𝑑𝑡", "bbox": [132.20399475097656, 293.2762145996094, 140.30963134765625, 324.4075622558594]}, {"text": "= 𝑘4[HBrO2][Br−][H+] + 𝑘5[BrO−", "bbox": [153.77499389648438, 276.03411865234375, 306.3299865722656, 341.9865417480469]}, {"text": "3 ][Br−][H+]2 (eq.5.2)", "bbox": [300.18798828125, 276.03411865234375, 397.31976318359375, 341.9865417480469]}, {"text": "−𝑑[Br−]", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 298.68060302734375, 149.81179809570312, 358.0381774902344]}, {"text": "𝑑𝑡", "bbox": [132.20399475097656, 317.18621826171875, 140.30963134765625, 348.31756591796875]}, {"text": "= (𝑘4[HBrO2]𝐵[H+] + 𝑘5[BrO−", "bbox": [153.77499389648438, 299.94415283203125, 295.0619812011719, 365.8965759277344]}, {"text": "3 ][H+]2) [Br−] = 𝑘∗[Br−]", "bbox": [288.91998291015625, 299.9441833496094, 403.7384948730469, 365.8966064453125]}, {"text": "where", "bbox": [114.69094848632812, 348.67352294921875, 143.9407958984375, 362.2407531738281]}, {"text": "𝑘∗= 𝑘4[HBrO2]𝐵[H+] + 𝑘5[BrO−", "bbox": [114.69094848632812, 347.76513671875, 263.4649353027344, 413.7175598144531]}, {"text": "3 ][H+]2 (eq.5.3)", "bbox": [257.32293701171875, 347.76513671875, 330.2196960449219, 413.7175598144531]}, {"text": "Thus, we obtain a first order kinetic equation. For this equation:", "bbox": [114.69091796875, 396.49346923828125, 412.26446533203125, 410.0606994628906]}, {"text": "𝑘∗= 2.0 × 109 × 5.04 × 10−11 × 0.8 + 2.1 × 0.06 × 0.82 = 0.16128 s−1", "bbox": [114.69091796875, 401.5029296875, 406.61712646484375, 440.0790710449219]}, {"text": "[Br−]𝑐𝑟𝑖𝑡𝑖𝑐𝑎𝑙= [Br−]𝑚𝑎𝑥⋅𝑒−𝑘∗𝜏", "bbox": [114.69091796875, 419.49609375, 251.56907653808594, 485.4485168457031]}, {"text": "𝜏= ln([Br−]𝑚𝑎𝑥/[Br−]𝑐𝑟𝑖𝑡𝑖𝑐𝑎𝑙)", "bbox": [114.69093322753906, 443.7505798339844, 235.52220153808594, 503.108154296875]}, {"text": "𝑘∗", "bbox": [179.67098999023438, 464.12921142578125, 188.69937133789062, 495.26055908203125]}, {"text": "(eq.5.4)", "bbox": [242.38699340820312, 446.88812255859375, 273.9277648925781, 512.8405151367188]}, {"text": "𝜏=", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 489.69598388671875, 129.37586975097656, 524.2861328125]}, {"text": "ln(7.0×10−4/(3.0×10−7))", "bbox": [133.34698486328125, 481.78070068359375, 232.10955810546875, 517.4705200195312]}, {"text": "0.16128 𝑠−1", "bbox": [159.9199981689453, 498.5362243652344, 205.03855895996094, 529.6675415039062]}, {"text": "= 48 s", "bbox": [236.072998046875, 489.69598388671875, 262.98712158203125, 524.2861328125]}, {"text": "For values [HBrO2]B = 1.0 × 10−10 M and [Br−]critical = 1.0 × 10−7 M:", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 503.70416259765625, 428.1136779785156, 569.6565551757812]}, {"text": "𝑘∗= 2.0 × 109 × 1.0 × 10−10 × 0.8 + 2.1 × 0.06 × 0.82 = 0.24064 s−1", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 533.5319213867188, 401.63519287109375, 572.1070556640625]}, {"text": "𝜏=", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 571.011962890625, 129.3758544921875, 605.6021118164062]}, {"text": "ln(", "bbox": [133.34698486328125, 567.15625, 146.48318481445312, 598.2875366210938]}, {"text": "[Br−]𝑚𝑎𝑥", "bbox": [153.06198120117188, 553.12646484375, 187.13829040527344, 605.8884887695312]}, {"text": "[Br−]𝑐𝑟𝑖𝑡𝑖𝑐𝑎𝑙)", "bbox": [147.67800903320312, 562.5674438476562, 199.66757202148438, 615.3294677734375]}, {"text": "𝑘∗", "bbox": [161.74400329589844, 578.3502197265625, 170.77236938476562, 609.4815063476562]}, {"text": "=", "bbox": [203.6300048828125, 571.011962890625, 210.4543914794922, 605.6021118164062]}, {"text": "ln(7.0×10−4/(1.0×10−7))", "bbox": [214.41799926757812, 563.0306396484375, 313.1805725097656, 598.7205200195312]}, {"text": "0.24064 s−1", "bbox": [240.52999877929688, 580.3096923828125, 286.57012939453125, 612.2955322265625]}, {"text": "= 37 s", "bbox": [317.14398193359375, 571.011962890625, 344.0581359863281, 605.6021118164062]}, {"text": "For correct equations 5.1, 5.2 and 5.3: 2 points each.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 609.8375244140625, 358.88494873046875, 623.4047241210938]}, {"text": "For correct equation 5.4: 1 point.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 621.7925415039062, 268.16552734375, 635.3597412109375]}, {"text": "For calculated 𝑘∗value: 1 point.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 617.4031982421875, 262.287841796875, 653.4231567382812]}, {"text": "For calculated 𝜏value: 1 point.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 630.7880249023438, 256.8008728027344, 665.378173828125]}, {"text": "For correct calculation without formula derivation: full marks.", "bbox": [114.6910171508789, 657.6585693359375, 402.05291748046875, 671.2257690429688]}, {"text": "9.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 166.15451049804688, 521.8194580078125, 179.72174072265625]}]}, {"page": 7, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q2-7", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "2.6", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 166.2294921875, 92.84233856201172, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "What will be the effect if the following actions (1-4) are performed on an open", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 166.2294921875, 480.5633544921875, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "system where a BZ reaction is taking place? Tick only one box (a-e) for each", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 178.18450927734375, 480.5770568847656, 191.75173950195312]}, {"text": "case.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 190.1405029296875, 138.1237030029297, 203.70773315429688]}, {"text": "1. Adding of small amount of Ce4+", "bbox": [121.06700134277344, 203.72413635253906, 282.1211853027344, 269.6765441894531]}, {"text": "during Process A.", "bbox": [121.06700134277344, 240.4974822998047, 204.81063842773438, 254.06471252441406]}, {"text": "2. Adding of a small amount of Ag+", "bbox": [121.06700134277344, 229.9481201171875, 286.6520080566406, 295.9005432128906]}, {"text": "during Process B.", "bbox": [121.0670166015625, 266.72149658203125, 204.6306610107422, 280.2887268066406]}, {"text": "3. Adding of a small amount of Br−", "bbox": [121.06702423095703, 253.85812377929688, 285.1580505371094, 319.810546875]}, {"text": "during Process B.", "bbox": [121.06703186035156, 290.6314697265625, 204.6306610107422, 304.1986999511719]}, {"text": "4. Continuous addition of Br−.", "bbox": [121.06702423095703, 277.76812744140625, 263.0596618652344, 343.7215270996094]}, {"text": "[ a ] prolongs Process A", "bbox": [316.36798095703125, 240.49749755859375, 427.9091491699219, 254.06472778320312]}, {"text": "[ b ] prolongs Process B", "bbox": [316.36798095703125, 254.7664794921875, 428.2691955566406, 268.3337097167969]}, {"text": "[ c ] Process A switches to Process B", "bbox": [316.36798095703125, 266.72149658203125, 487.21319580078125, 280.2887268066406]}, {"text": "[ d ] Process B switches to Process A", "bbox": [316.36798095703125, 278.676513671875, 488.57012939453125, 292.2437438964844]}, {"text": "[ e ] oscillations stop", "bbox": [316.36798095703125, 290.6315002441406, 411.4234924316406, 304.19873046875]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 330.04150390625, 169.74588012695312, 343.6087341308594]}, {"text": "[a]", "bbox": [251.08399963378906, 356.6195068359375, 263.22943115234375, 370.1867370605469]}, {"text": "[b]", "bbox": [277.8009948730469, 356.6195068359375, 290.4844055175781, 370.1867370605469]}, {"text": "[c]", "bbox": [305.4620056152344, 356.6195068359375, 316.8004455566406, 370.1867370605469]}, {"text": "[d]", "bbox": [331.7749938964844, 356.6195068359375, 344.4584045410156, 370.1867370605469]}, {"text": "[e]", "bbox": [359.0169982910156, 356.6195068359375, 371.19232177734375, 370.1867370605469]}, {"text": "1.", "bbox": [222.85400390625, 372.5605163574219, 231.22325134277344, 386.12774658203125]}, {"text": "×", "bbox": [307.9429931640625, 357.6449890136719, 314.3190612792969, 392.2351379394531]}, {"text": "2.", "bbox": [222.85400390625, 388.50048828125, 231.22325134277344, 402.0677185058594]}, {"text": "×", "bbox": [334.92999267578125, 373.5849609375, 341.3060607910156, 408.17510986328125]}, {"text": "3.", "bbox": [222.85400390625, 404.44049072265625, 231.22325134277344, 418.0077209472656]}, {"text": "×", "bbox": [280.95599365234375, 389.52496337890625, 287.3320617675781, 424.1151123046875]}, {"text": "4.", "bbox": [222.85400390625, 420.3804931640625, 231.22325134277344, 433.9477233886719]}, {"text": "×", "bbox": [361.9169921875, 405.4649658203125, 368.2930603027344, 440.05511474609375]}, {"text": "1. “Adding of small amount of Ce4+ during Process A” will lead to the formation", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 425.84014892578125, 480.5867614746094, 491.7925720214844]}, {"text": "of Br−in Process C, there will be 𝑟1 < 𝑟4 and “[ c ] Process A switches to Process", "bbox": [114.69102478027344, 437.7951354980469, 480.5899658203125, 503.74755859375]}, {"text": "B”.", "bbox": [114.6910400390625, 474.5684814453125, 127.63224792480469, 488.1357116699219]}, {"text": "2. “Adding of small amount of Ag+ during Process B” will lead to precipitation", "bbox": [114.6910400390625, 461.7051086425781, 480.5963134765625, 527.6575317382812]}, {"text": "of AgBr, there will be 𝑟1 > 𝑟4 and “[ d ] Process B switches to Process A”.", "bbox": [114.6910400390625, 483.56292724609375, 450.6732482910156, 520.64404296875]}, {"text": "3. “Adding of small amount of Br−during Process B” will lead to increase in", "bbox": [114.69107055664062, 485.61505126953125, 480.5901794433594, 551.5684814453125]}, {"text": "[Br−]max value, accordingly, the time required to reduce [Br−]max to [Br−]critical", "bbox": [114.69107055664062, 497.57110595703125, 480.0860900878906, 563.5234985351562]}, {"text": "will be extended, so it will “[ b ] prolongs Process B”.", "bbox": [114.69107055664062, 534.3444213867188, 358.4512634277344, 547.91162109375]}, {"text": "4. “Continuously adding of Br−\" will lead to the concentration of Br−always", "bbox": [114.69107055664062, 521.4810180664062, 480.58709716796875, 587.4334106445312]}, {"text": "being above the [Br−]critical value and Process B never switching to Process A,", "bbox": [114.69107055664062, 533.43603515625, 480.5846862792969, 599.388427734375]}, {"text": "so it will “[ e ] stop oscillations”.", "bbox": [114.69107055664062, 570.2094116210938, 259.8368835449219, 583.776611328125]}, {"text": "For correct answers: 1 point each.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 582.16552734375, 273.2563781738281, 595.7327270507812]}, {"text": "4.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 166.15451049804688, 521.8194580078125, 179.72174072265625]}]}, {"page": 8, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q2-8", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "2.7", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 169.37950134277344, 92.84233856201172, 182.9467315673828]}, {"text": "Which graph qualitatively illustrates the rate of change of Gibbs energy (𝑑𝐺", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 152.23721313476562, 464.0344543457031, 189.05410766601562]}, {"text": "𝑑𝑡) of", "bbox": [454.12298583984375, 154.46397399902344, 480.5848388671875, 192.93356323242188]}, {"text": "a closed system in which an oscillatory reaction occurs? Tick the correct box.", "bbox": [114.69094848632812, 182.83450317382812, 474.23870849609375, 196.4017333984375]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 194.7895050048828, 169.74588012695312, 208.3567352294922]}, {"text": "In the oscillatory reaction, the Gibbs energy exhibits oscillatory behavior over", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 206.74549865722656, 480.60821533203125, 220.31272888183594]}, {"text": "time, rather than decreasing monotonically as in most typical chemical reac-", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 218.70050048828125, 480.5951843261719, 232.26773071289062]}, {"text": "tions. In closed systems, the oscillations dampen over time →the system even-", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 230.65550231933594, 480.6051025390625, 244.2227325439453]}, {"text": "tually reaches equilibrium (d𝐺", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 228.4982147216797, 257.5963439941406, 259.6295471191406]}, {"text": "d𝑡= 0). dG must be less than 0 every time. So,", "bbox": [247.4759979248047, 220.82113647460938, 480.5892639160156, 286.7735595703125]}, {"text": "correct answer is last one:", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 259.53448486328125, 236.4047393798828, 273.1017150878906]}, {"text": "For correct answer: 3 points.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 593.8405151367188, 248.51927185058594, 607.40771484375]}, {"text": "For ticking middle left box which describes d𝐺", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 591.6832275390625, 327.9623107910156, 622.8145141601562]}, {"text": "d𝑡of a non-oscillatory reaction in a", "bbox": [317.84197998046875, 601.708251953125, 480.5894470214844, 632.8395385742188]}, {"text": "closed system: 1 point.", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 622.7205200195312, 221.87928771972656, 636.2877197265625]}, {"text": "3.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 169.30349731445312, 521.8194580078125, 182.8707275390625]}]}]